From 2df1eb9476167912f28907634c3067d3acca4249 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jessie McDonald <jessie.x.mac@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:04:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tax year labelled by end year

tax_year() now returns the year the tax year ends: 6 April 2027 to
5 April 2028 is 2028, not 2027. Every caller and test moves with it:
the cash sub-limit's first year is now 2028 (2027/28), the allowance
query takes age at 6 April of the year before the label, and the
allowance-ledger spec says how tax years are labelled.

Spec-REQ: REQ-ALW-001 REQ-ALW-003 REQ-ALW-004

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
